# Behind the Mask's "you may collect evidence 6" (CR 701.59a) paid with exactly 6: Craw Wurm (mana value 6) alone is exiled from Bot1's graveyard,
# leaving the spent Faithless Looting (mana value 1) there, and the evidence turns Bot1's Ornithopter into a 1/1 (not 4/3) that attacks for 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Faithless Looting
Behind the Mask
Craw Wurm
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Craw Wurm; Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Behind the Mask.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Modes(Collect evidence)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Craw Wurm)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Craw Wurm
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Behind the Mask; Faithless Looting; Island
